5,1,1,talk,Shizue,,I worry about the timeline. We need to see what actually delays our projects.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Yumi,,Agreed. I want to know how much space we lose while work is happening.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,George,,The staff are stretched thin. I need to see who is doing the upkeep.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,We should check if the previous projects were actually useful to people.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,"The budget figures look nice on paper, but reality is different. I need proof.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Benjamin, do you have specific numbers in mind?","{""words"":8,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Yumi,,I think looking at the timetables will show the hidden cost of closure.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,George,,I am looking at the staffing posts. It is a quiet crisis.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Mizuki,,Post-occupancy reviews seem like the right place to start for me.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"I will look at the tender records. Inflation is real, even if we ignore it.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Shizue,,Weather is a big factor too. I will check the site diaries.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Yumi,,Booking data might show if we even need more specialist rooms.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,George,,I will also look at the technicians' routines. They are doing manual work.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Mizuki,,I will check the survey findings in the older blocks. Hazards are a risk.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,I will also look at the renewal reserve. We never plan for replacement.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Shizue,,Let us see what the data says.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Yumi,,I hope it clarifies things.,"{""words"":5,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,George,,We must be careful not to overburden the existing team.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Mizuki,,Data will help us make a fair choice.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,"Logic over emotion, please.","{""words"":4,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
