35,2,1,talk,Shizue,,The weather lost us six weeks. That is a lot of time.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Yumi,,I found that we pay for off-site space for two terms. That is expensive.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,George,,The technicians are doing hours of manual checks. It is inefficient.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Mizuki,,The older blocks have hazards. That adds months to any project there.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Benjamin,,Mechanical costs rose by a fifth. We are underestimating the plant work.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Mizuki, does that mean we should avoid the older blocks?","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Yumi,,"The specialist rooms are idle, but general rooms are full. We need general space.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,George,,"If we upgrade the labs, the technicians might have less manual work.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Mizuki,,"Yes, the hazards are a major delay factor.","{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Benjamin,,"The lack of a renewal reserve is a trap. We buy, then we are stuck.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Shizue,,The delivery schedules show comfort projects slip. We need to be realistic.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Yumi,,"So, a study commons might be better than a media center?","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,George,,"The lab upgrade helps the staff, but it is costly.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Mizuki,,Post-occupancy ratings were highest for bookable spaces. That supports a commons.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Benjamin,,"The path network is cheaper, but does it solve the core problem?","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Shizue,,I am leaning towards something that doesn't delay the calendar.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Yumi,,I agree. The study commons seems practical.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,George,,"I am concerned about the lab upgrade cost, but the staff need it.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Mizuki,,The data supports the commons. It is bookable and useful.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Benjamin,,The commons has lower mechanical costs. That is a plus.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
